  "contentHtml": "\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">kfc coleslaw brings equal parts nostalgia and sunny picnic vibes, wrapping every bite in a creamy, tangy hug. This homemade take tosses finely shredded green and purple cabbage with sweet carrots in a lush dressing of mayo, buttermilk, apple cider vinegar, a hint of sugar, and bright lemon juice. A touch of honey nudges the sweet-tart balance just right, while celery seeds add a gentle, classic note. Let it chill so the flavors meld and the crunch stays lively. kfc coleslaw is perfect alongside fried chicken, stacked on burgers, or packed solo in your picnic basket for spoonfuls of pure happiness.</p>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-rank-math-toc-block\" id=\"rank-math-toc\"><h2>Table of Contents</h2><nav><ul><li><a href=\"#why-youll-love-this-kfc-coleslaw\">Why You’ll Love This KFC Coleslaw</a></li><li><a href=\"#ingredients\">Ingredients</a></li><li><a href=\"#how-to-make-kfc-coleslaw\">How to Make KFC Coleslaw</a></li><li><a href=\"#recipe-snapshot\">Recipe Snapshot</a></li><li><a href=\"#pro-tips-for-making-kfc-coleslaw\">Pro Tips for Making KFC Coleslaw</a></li><li><a href=\"#how-to-serve-this-kfc-coleslaw\">How to Serve this KFC Coleslaw</a></li><li><a href=\"#make-ahead-and-storage\">Make Ahead and Storage</a></li><li><a href=\"#fa-qs\">FAQs</a></li><li><a href=\"#final-thoughts\">Final Thoughts</a></li></ul></nav></div>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"why-youll-love-this-kfc-coleslaw\"><strong>Why You’ll Love This KFC Coleslaw</strong></h2>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>It’s a creamy, tangy delight that perfectly complements any meal.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Made with fresh ingredients, it’s a healthier choice for your sides.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Easy to whip up at home, saving you a trip to the drive-thru.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Customize it to your taste with extra crunch or sweetness!</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n<div id=\"wprm-recipe-container-5238\" class=\"wprm-recipe-container\" data-recipe-id=\"5238\" data-servi